<title>GERMANY: German Aug insolvencies rise 8.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German Aug insolvencies rise 8.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INSOLVENCIES	Aug 96	    Jan-Aug 96</p>
<p> Total insolvencies		2,531		  20,797</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +8.4		   +11.1</p>
<p> Company insolvencies	    2,075		  16,872</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		  +13.8		   +17.1</p>
<p>W.GERMAN INSOLVENCIES</p>
<p> Total insolvencies		1,871		  15,239</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +7.4		    +6.6</p>
<p> Company insolvencies	    1,478		  11,967</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		  +11.8		   +10.6</p>
<p>E.GERMAN INSOLVENCIES</p>
<p> Total insolvencies		  660		   5,558</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		  +11.3		   +25.3</p>
<p> Company insolvencies		597		   4,905</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		  +19.2		   +36.7</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
